<title>USA: AccuMed says in pact with Leica.</title>
<headline>AccuMed says in pact with Leica.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuMed International Inc said it signed a letter of intent with Leica Microscopy &amp; Systems GmbH of Germany.</p>
<p>Leica will distribute AccuMed's AcCell Cytopathology System in Europe, Asia and other world markets, as well as work with AccuMed on new products using technologies from both companies, AccuMed said.</p>
<p>The joint marketing distribution relationship begins immediately with both companies developing a sales and marketing plan during first quarter 1997 to be supported by AccuMed's European operation, the company said.</p>
<p>AccuMed makes laboratory diagnostics systems.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
